 "text": [
  "Each strip is frames stacked top to bottom with a transparent row between; \"frames\" gives each one as [y, height]. The ships and aliens have 32, pointing up at frame 0 and turning clockwise.",
  "ship 110 (yours), shield 650, aliens 250 290 370 460, blaster 210 (the MultiBlaster, 8), puffer 330 (the Puffer, 15), rocks 100 (Rocko and Pebbles), base 150 (yours, turning), enemybase 530, yummies 410, mines 440, shots 200-202, life 590, title 600.",
  "The bestiary, in the module's own words: the MultiBlaster, four gun barrels so he can shoot a lot if he wants to; the Puffer, he'll smoke you if you don't watch out; the Hammerhead; the Slicer; the Sludger, which lays mines."
 ]
